# Opening Reflection

Before you begin the AI 101 Professional Learning Series, take a moment to reflect on your goals.

You may want to learn about new AI tools, feel more confident explaining AI to a 5th grade student, explore ways AI can support differentiation in your classroom, or develop strategies to help teachers monitor AI use.

> In the **Padlet** below, answer the following question: If you were to describe your goal in a hashtag, what would it be?


